abstract: >-
  EduLogGen is an open-source Python framework for analysing real learner
  interaction logs, generating privacy-aware synthetic logs with Markov and
  semi-Markov models, validating them against the real data with fidelity
  and privacy indicators, and benchmarking generators under a fixed
  protocol. Its experimental layer adds labelled anomalies, behavioural
  controls, course calendars, and behavioural profiles with ground truth for
  evaluating detection and clustering methods.
